# ${SRC_DIR}/components/

Cross-feature UI for ${PROJECT_NAME}. Anything specific to one feature lives in `features/<name>/components/` instead.

## Layout

| Subfolder | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| [`ui/`](ui/) | Base primitives (Button, Input, Card). Bare on purpose — wire your design system here. |
| [`layout/`](layout/) | App-shell components (header, footer, sidebar) shared across routes. |

## Naming

- PascalCase component file: `Button.tsx`, `AppShell.tsx`.
- Co-located test next to the component or under `${SRC_DIR}/tests/unit/` — pick one and stay consistent.

